WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.310
Iitaka's conjecture on fibrations.

2
00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:05.342
Cut a space into fibres over a base;

3
00:00:05.342 --> 00:00:07.478
its Kodaira dimension beats fibre plus base.

4
00:00:08.900 --> 00:00:11.165
Rewrite the space's forms on the base;

5
00:00:11.165 --> 00:00:13.429
a positive Hodge line gives the inequality.

6
00:00:14.200 --> 00:00:17.481
Claimed: proved in characteristic zero, every dimension.

7
00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.384
Lean checks only part.
